System Health Check and Configuration Report
-------------------------------------------
Generated   : {{ ansible_facts.date_time.iso8601 }}
Hostname    : {{ ansible_facts.hostname }} ({{ ansible_facts.fqdn }})
Uptime      : {{ uptime_output.stdout }}
Load Avg    : {{ loadavg_output.stdout.split()[0] }} (1m) / {{ loadavg_output.stdout.split()[1] }} (5m) / {{ loadavg_output.stdout.split()[2] }} (15m)
OS Version  : {{ ansible_facts.distribution }} {{ ansible_facts.distribution_version }} ({{ ansible_facts.distribution_release }})
Kernel      : {{ ansible_facts.kernel }}

CPU Info
--------
Architecture              : {{ ansible_facts.architecture }}
Model                     : {{ ansible_facts.processor[-1] if (ansible_facts.processor is defined and ansible_facts.processor | length > 0) else 'N/A' }}
Sockets                   : {{ ansible_facts.processor_count }}
Cores per Socket          : {{ ansible_facts.processor_cores }}
Total Physical Cores      : {{ ansible_facts.processor_cores * ansible_facts.processor_count }}
Total Logical CPUs (vCPUs): {{ ansible_facts.processor_vcpus }}

Memory Info
-----------
Total Memory (MB)   : {{ ansible_facts.memtotal_mb }}
Free Memory (MB)    : {{ ansible_facts.memfree_mb }}
Used Memory (MB)    : {{ ansible_facts.memtotal_mb - ansible_facts.memfree_mb }}
Memory Usage (%)    : {{ (((ansible_facts.memtotal_mb - ansible_facts.memfree_mb) / ansible_facts.memtotal_mb) * 100) | round(1) }}
Swap Total (MB)     : {{ ansible_facts.swaptotal_mb }}
Swap Free (MB)      : {{ ansible_facts.swapfree_mb }}

Disk Info
---------
{% for mount in ansible_facts.mounts %}
Device            : {{ mount.device }}
  Mount Point     : {{ mount.mount }}
  File System Type: {{ mount.fstype }}
  Total Space (GB): {{ (mount.size_total / 1024 / 1024 / 1024) | round(2) }}
  Available (GB)  : {{ (mount.size_available / 1024 / 1024 / 1024) | round(2) }}
  Used (GB)       : {{ ((mount.size_total - mount.size_available) / 1024 / 1024 / 1024) | round(2) }}
  Usage (%)       : {{ (((mount.size_total - mount.size_available) / mount.size_total) * 100) | round(1) if mount.size_total > 0 else 0 }}
{% endfor %}
Network Info (cumulative counters, excludes loopback)
-------------------------------------------------------
Bytes Sent       : {{ net_info.bytes_sent }}
Bytes Received   : {{ net_info.bytes_received }}
Packets Sent     : {{ net_info.packets_sent }}
Packets Received : {{ net_info.packets_received }}

Critical Services Status
-------------------------
{% for svc, status in service_status.items() %}
{{ "%-15s" | format(svc) }}: {{ status }}
{% endfor %}
